---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FlipHero from '../../components/FlipHero.astro';

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'NewsArticle',
    '@id': 'https://www.garylucy.co.uk/news/sos-global-ai#article',
    headline: 'Gary Lucy Launches SOS Global AI',
    description:
      "UK actor and entrepreneur Gary Lucy has launched SOS Global AI, a UK-built company developing sector-specific AI systems for recruitment and television development.",
    datePublished: '2026-10-10',
    dateModified: '2026-10-10',
    author: { '@id': 'https://www.garylucy.co.uk/#person' },
    publisher: { '@id': 'https://www.garylucy.co.uk/#person' },
    mainEntityOfPage: 'https://www.garylucy.co.uk/news/sos-global-ai',
    image: 'https://www.garylucy.co.uk/hero/gl-sitting-bw-web.jpg',
  },
];
---
<Layout
  title="Gary Lucy Launches SOS Global AI | News"
  description="UK actor and entrepreneur Gary Lucy has launched SOS Global AI, a UK-built company developing sector-specific AI systems for recruitment and television development."
  path="/news/sos-global-ai"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <article class="rs-page">
    <FlipHero
      id="sos-global-ai"
      imageFront="/hero/gl-sitting-bw-web.jpg"
      imageBack="/gallery/gary-lucy-fuselage-1600.jpg"
      altFront="Gary Lucy, British actor and entrepreneur"
      altBack="Gary Lucy on location"
      kicker="Exclusive"
      headline="Gary Lucy's Window Into<br />The Future Of Entertainment"
      dek="SOS Global AI at the cutting edge: inside the actor-turned-entrepreneur's new company for recruitment and television development."
      backKicker="The Launch"
      backHeadline="Read On &raquo;"
    />

    <div class="rs-body">
      <nav class="rs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/news">News</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">SOS Global AI</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="rs-byline">
        <span>Gary Lucy Launches SOS Global AI</span>
        <span>10 October 2026</span>
      </div>

      <p class="rs-lede">
        Sector-specific AI systems for recruitment and television development, built on
        early scrutiny, independent challenge and human sign-off &mdash; with a named
        person accountable for every decision.
      </p>

      <p>
        Gary Lucy, Founder and Commercial Lead of SOS Global AI, has launched the
        company at <a href="https://sosglobalai.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sosglobalai.com</a>.
        It builds sector-specific AI systems, run by teams of specialist AI agents
        that each do one job thoroughly, with a named person holding final
        accountability for the outcome.
      </p>

      <p>
        The company starts with two divisions, Recruitment and Entertainment. A
        third, Financial, is in development to the same standard. Gary leads all
        three and stays directly involved in every enquiry, including NDA requests
        and partnership conversations.
      </p>

      <hr class="rs-divider" />
      <h2 class="rs-section-title">Why SOS Global AI Exists</h2>

      <p>
        Lucy has spent 25 years as a professional actor, with credits including
        <em>Hollyoaks</em>, <em>Footballers' Wives</em> and <em>The Bill</em>. In
        parallel he has built and run businesses across property, retail, digital
        marketing and television format development. The pattern he saw across
        those industries was consistent: decisions get made on relationships,
        confidence and urgency, and the hard questions come too late, if at all.
        Is this candidate compliant today? Does this project have a buyer? Does
        this rights position hold up?
      </p>

      <p>
        SOS Global AI exists to move those questions to the front of the process.
        Speed matters, but only once a decision has a sound basis.
      </p>

      <hr class="rs-divider" />
      <h2 class="rs-section-title">Entertainment: Find The Weakness Before The Buyer Does</h2>

      <p>
        SOS Global Entertainment is a development pipeline for television IP.
        Projects move through seven stages covering concept and originality,
        story architecture, market intelligence, platform strategy, production,
        rights, and commercial readiness. Two hard gates stop a project until it
        has named, real buyers and fully cleared rights.
      </p>

      <p>
        The pipeline covers five content types: long-form drama, vertical drama,
        formats, scripted reality and factual. Each is developed against its own
        commercial requirements. A dedicated challenge function exists to find
        the reason a project won't work, with the authority to send it back, so
        the hardest questions are asked internally rather than in front of a
        commissioner. The creative work stays human-led. The system exists to
        stress-test it.
      </p>

      <hr class="rs-divider" />
      <h2 class="rs-section-title">Recruitment: Built Where Compliance Failure Costs Most</h2>

      <p>
        SOS Global Recruitment is built first for UK healthcare staffing.
        Candidate sourcing works only from an agency's own consented records.
        Compliance is checked at screening and verified again on placement day
        against the current authoritative source, and a named human approves
        every output before it reaches a client. The platform is structured to
        extend into US and international markets without a rebuild.
      </p>

      <hr class="rs-divider" />
      <h2 class="rs-section-title">Responsibility And Governance By Design</h2>

      <p>
        Six public commitments apply across every SOS Global system: human
        oversight at every tier, consented data only, compliance verified live,
        structural independent challenge, client data isolation, and new
        capabilities run in simulation until proven safe. The full position is
        published at
        <a href="https://sosglobalai.com/trust" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sosglobalai.com/trust</a>,
        with detailed documentation available to qualified partners under NDA.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="rs-pullquote">
        &ldquo;I started SOS Global AI because I got tired of watching good
        projects die to bad process. In television and in recruitment, the
        failure is the same: the hard question gets asked too late. We built
        systems that ask it first, and a person you can name stays accountable
        for the answer.&rdquo;
        <footer>&mdash; Gary Lucy, Founder and Commercial Lead, SOS Global AI</footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="rs-pullquote">
        &ldquo;Responsibility isn't a page on our website. It's how the systems
        are built. Human sign-off, consented data, live compliance checks and an
        independent challenge function are in the architecture from day one,
        not added when a client asks. I'm proud of that, and I'm proud of the
        specialists behind it. A governed system you can inspect will always
        beat a fast one you have to take on trust.&rdquo;
        <footer>&mdash; Gary Lucy</footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="rs-pullquote">
        &ldquo;I built this to stay hands-on, not hand it off, but hands-on
        doesn't mean hovering. Every specialist gets real ownership of their
        function; I want people who do their best work when I get out of their
        way, not people waiting to be managed. Leads at every level are there to
        encourage, evaluate and push the standard up, never to control the work
        underneath them. We chase real innovation hard, but integrity is what
        earns trust.&rdquo;
        <footer>&mdash; Gary Lucy, from sosglobalai.com/about</footer>
      </blockquote>

      <hr class="rs-divider" />
      <h2 class="rs-section-title">About SOS Global AI</h2>

      <p>
        SOS Global AI is a UK-headquartered company building sector-specific AI
        systems for recruitment, entertainment development and, in time,
        financial intelligence. Each division is run as its own operation with
        dedicated specialist functions and a named lead accountable for its
        output. SOS Global AI Limited is registered in England and Wales,
        Company No. 17412139.
      </p>

      <p class="rs-note">
        Media and partnership enquiries:
        <a href="https://sosglobalai.com/contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sosglobalai.com/contact</a>
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="https://sosglobalai.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="accent">Visit sosglobalai.com &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
